# Seedance 2.0

> Seedance 2.0 Reference to Video generates videos from images or existing videos, allowing customization of duration, resolution, aspect ratio, and audio inputs. It supports image-to-video and video-to-video transformations with optional audio generation.

## Overview

- **Endpoint**: `https://api.higgsfield.ai/bytedance/seedance-2.0/reference-to-video`
- **Model ID**: `bytedance/seedance-2.0/reference-to-video`
- **Category**: image2video, video2video
- **Kind**: inference
- **Tags**: featured, trending, partners, commercial_use

## Pricing

Token-metered pricing. Billable video tokens = ceil((input video seconds + generated video seconds) × output width × output height × 24 fps / 1024). Image and audio references do not count as video input. Per 1,000 video tokens: without video input — 480p/720p/1080p $0.014, 4K $0.008; with video input — 480p/720p/1080p $0.0084, 4K $0.0048 (0.6× the standard rate). With video references, both input and generated video durations are billable. Rates shown are before any applicable customer discount.

